{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-125",
  "title": "Upload Process (SPEAK MPLS)",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Upload Process (SPEAK MPLS)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 1: REVIEW THE VIDEO CONTENT SUBMISSION FORM"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Receive an email from the `info@example.com` email that indicates a content submission has been received."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Open the SPEAK MPLS Content Submission Form."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Scroll down to the latest submission at the bottom of the document or click on the date in ascending order to see the newest submission at the top."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP D"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Review the submission for the following:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Did they indicate they need to complete the Welcome to SPEAK MPLS tour and orientation? If yes, contact Geesh to set that up."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Did they submit a link, or upload file/s on our website?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Did they mark that their program is 17+? If yes, it will need to be programmed in the LATE NIGHT timeslot, which is Midnight to 5am. Make a note that it will need to be preceded by our 17+ disclaimer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Are there any notes that stand out that you need to look into?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Have they been assigned a timeslot yet?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Did they answer all relevant questions related to Minneapolis-related content, non-English content, etc?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Starting in 2024, check Nexudus to ensure that the member has completed at least two things, which will be recorded under their account > Account Details > Internal Notes:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Have an ID on file"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Have completed the Membership Terms and Conditions form"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If you do not see that these things are in their Nexudus account, please contact Geesh to confirm they are on file."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP E"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Once you have initially reviewed the file submission, turn the spreadsheet line yellow for that submission to keep track of where you are and to indicate to the team that you are working on it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Color Key:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**GREEN**: Complete - the file has been programmed and the confirmation email sent out to the member."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**YELLOW**: Working on it - file conversion in progress, and email communication not sent out yet."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**RED**: Stuck and needs follow-up - It is the Broadcast manager’s responsibility to reach out to the member or SPEAK MPLS staff for further assistance."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP F"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If the submission is from a new member who hasn’t submitted yet in the quarter, please add them to the Unique Producers- Quarterly Report spreadsheet. This document should be updated with every new unique producer submission in the quarter as soon as they submit. The updates to this list will be provided as weekly updates during team meetings or on Slack."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Note**: If a member submission is not submitted via the Video Content Submission form, please enter the information manually. It is important to track every submission so that the SPEAK MPLS team can access it. Accessing the studio is dependent on members submitting content, and this documentation process needs to be updated regularly and in real-time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This system allows us to track member submissions for the quarterly report more easily."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 2: ACCESS SERVER COMPUTER REMOTELY"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Connect to OpenVPN Connect."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Open VNC Viewer."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Select the window `192.168.61.14`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP D"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You are now remoted into the server computer at SPNN!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 3: LOCATE THE SUBMITTED FILES"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP A1: FIND FILE SUBMISSIONS ON THE SERVER"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To access the drive that has the files that have been uploaded through our online submission, locate the Data 1: (D Drive). There is a shortcut on the desktop. Navigate to the File Submit folder, and there you will find the `prog_uploads` folder. If they submitted on the website, it goes directly to the program uploads folder that is located on the server computer here."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP A2: DOWNLOAD THE SUBMITTED FILES FROM LINKS"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If members submitted a link (YouTube or Vimeo, for example), you will have to find a downloader for the link and then upload it yourself on the SPEAK MPLS website."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here are a few links to some downloaders I've used:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-49",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[yt5s.io](https://yt5s.io/en) - best for HD"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-50",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[y2mate.is](https://en.y2mate.is/77/)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-51",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[btclod.com](https://btclod.com/e3280)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-52",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[savethevideo.com](https://www.savethevideo.com/vimeo-downloader) (for Vimeo)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-53",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**FACEBOOK**: [fdown.net](https://www.notion.so/turtlelabs/fdown.net) (retire usage)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 4: QUALITY CHECK #1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Once you have the files ready in the Program Uploads folder, you need to check the files to make sure they play. Open the submitted file by double-clicking. It should open in the VLC player."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Make sure the video plays, and that it has sound. Scrub through to make sure everything looks good with the file."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "ERRORS"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-61",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If the file will not open in VLC, you will need to contact the member to have them re-upload the file."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-62",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If the file was downloaded from a link, try to re-download or try another downloader."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 5: CONVERT THE FILES FOR BROADCAST"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Open the mmfpeg program by double-clicking the shortcut that is located on the desktop."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Select the files from the `prog_uploads` folder that need to be converted, and drag them into the mmfpeg program shortcut that is located on the desktop. It will take a moment to process, and you will see all of the files you dragged over pop up in the program."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Watch for the blue status bar, which will tell you the status of each conversion. When your content is done processing in the mmfpeg system, it will appear in the converted folder in Drive D."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "ERRORS"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If mmfpeg gives you an error, go back to the original file to see if it opens in VLC. If it does, just try running the file through the converter again."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 6: QUALITY CHECK #2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Open the converted file by double-clicking. It should open in the VLC player."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Make sure the video plays, and that it has sound. Scrub through to make sure everything looks good with the file."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 7: TRANSFER CONVERTED FILES TO VIO4 SERVER"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Next, drag the converted file from the converted folder into the VIO4 content folder. This sends the content to the VIO4 server, which starts the upload process to Cablecast so you can begin to schedule it on the channels."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 8: ACCESS CABLECAST TO VERIFY UPLOAD"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Log in to the Cablecast website at [http://playback.speakmpls.com/](http://playback.speakmpls.com/)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Click on the Digital files tab on the left-hand side. The Digital files folder is where your content goes after you transfer it to the VIO4 folder."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-86",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-87",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To easily find the file you just sent to VIO4, navigate to the Processing or Unlinked tab. Once the file is ready to be programmed, it will show up in the Unlinked tab."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-88",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 9: ARCHIVE CONVERTED FILE, DELETE ORIGINAL"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-89",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This process frees up space in the program submission folder by deleting the original file and archives the converted file, just in case we need to access it again."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-90",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP A: DELETE ORIGINAL FILE"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "After all file quality checks and the upload verification to Cablecast have been completed, you can go to the original file in the `prog_uploads` folder and delete it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-92",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP B: ARCHIVE THE FILE"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-93",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Next, drag the converted file into the archive folder."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-94",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-95",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Once the file transfer to the Archive is complete, make sure all deleted files older than 30 days have been deleted."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-96",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 10: PREPARE THE FILE FOR BROADCAST"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-97",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP A: SELECT NEW SHOW"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-98",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Select the file and click on the ‘New show’ tab on the right-hand side."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-99",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP B: PULL UP SHOW DETAILS"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-100",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Make sure you have the SPEAK MPLS Content Submission Form pulled up, so you can enter all pertinent information for the show."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-101",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP C: CREATE A NEW CONFIRMATION EMAIL"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-102",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Have a confirmation email pulled up so you can easily copy the show details into the body of the email. Be sure to CC the `info@example.com` email when sending confirmation emails or any other communication about programming to members. This allows us to ensure the team is able to assist when members contact SPEAK MPLS about their programming."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-103",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**HERE** are the email templates to use."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-104",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP D: ENTER IN SHOW DETAILS"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-105",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Add the show details such as:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-110",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-106",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Title**: Lisa Butts Presents: Guest Matt Johnson"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-107",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Project**: (this is the series name “Lisa Butts Presents”)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-108",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Category**: Interview"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-109",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Producer**: Lisa Butts"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-111",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Please ensure the title is in the proper TV Guide format, as it will appear on our website. Each title should include the program title and the episode title."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-112",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If the person that submitted does not have a program title, or if they are only airing a one-off Open Format show, please use the following format:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-113",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**[Enter name] Presents: Enter episode title**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-114",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This format will allow us to better track Open Format submissions from that member and have a uniform presentation on the new website TV Guide."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-115",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP E"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-116",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Write down the show number/s on a piece of paper for when you need to program it in Step 11."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-117",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP F"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-118",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Copy and paste the show title into your confirmation email. It makes it easier to collect the information now in the body of the email for later."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-119",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 11: PROGRAM THE SHOW"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-120",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-121",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Assess if this show is a part of a series, or is Open Format."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-122",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-123",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If it is a series, check the Master Series Timeslot Schedule for when it airs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-124",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP C: ASSIGN AIR DATE, TIME AND CHANNEL"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-125",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If it is an Open Format show, refer to the SPEAK MPLS Content Submission Form for their requested timeslot and also refer to the timeslot schedule to make sure you aren’t airing it during a regular series timeslot."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-126",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Note**: It is important to keep track of if the member receives their first, second, or third choice for programming, since it is tracked in our Quarterly reports."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-127",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP D: NAVIGATE TO CHANNEL"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-128",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Once you have finalized the air date, time, and channel, select the Schedule tab on the left and choose between the following:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-132",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-129",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Channel 1 = Channel 16"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-130",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Channel 2 = Channel 17"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-131",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Channel 3 = Channel 75"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-133",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP E"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-134",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now, find the day and time according to the assigned series timeslot, or new requested time to schedule your show."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-135",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Please ensure that all programs start on the hour or the half-hour. This will help with the readability on our new TV Guide."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-136",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP F"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-137",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Once you have the program scheduled, add the air date, time, and channel to the confirmation email."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-138",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 12: ADD SHOW TO SCHEDULE + SHOW LIST"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-139",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-140",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If the show you just programmed is new, add it to the Master Series Timeslot Schedule. This will ensure that you do not give another person this series timeslot, and keeps all of the series timeslots in a place for all SPEAK MPLS team members to access."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-141",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-142",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Please add new TV show air channel, date, and time to the SPEAK MPLS TV Shows spreadsheet. This document serves as a reference for all TV Shows that we have aired and currently air."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-143",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This was included in STEP 1, but just adding it here as a reminder to complete."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-144",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 13: SEND EMAIL CONFIRMATION"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-145",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-146",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Once the show is programmed in, use the SPEAK MPLS TV Email Confirmation Template to send an email confirmation to the member, and to the `info@example.com` email."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-147",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "There are several templates to choose from, depending on if the content was a part of a series, or a stand-alone Open Format submission."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-148",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You’ll already have the show titles, and air dates, times, and channels in the email body, so this part should be easy!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-149",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "WEBSTREAM TROUBLESHOOTING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-150",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-151",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Check the web stream on the SPEAK MPLS website to see if each channel is running smoothly. Also, make sure to check playback to see if they are running on there."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-152",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-153",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If they are down, you can go into OBS on the VPN server located on the studio computer."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-154",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "At the bottom right-hand corner, you are going to see the OBS icon where you can view all three channels, along with a quad that shows all of them together at the same time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-155",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-156",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you are not seeing an image on the channel, you can go ahead and hit the tab that says ‘black’ on the left side of the screen. This will make all the channels turn black. To turn them back on, hit the ‘QUAD_RTMP’ button and it will reset them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-157",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-158",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The other option that you can do is hit the ‘stop streaming’ button and then hit ‘start recording’, this also helps to reset the channels."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-159",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "FILE UPLOADER TROUBLESHOOTING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-160",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "LOG-IN"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-164",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-161",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "URL: [https://192.168.161.31:8006/](https://192.168.161.31:8006/)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-162",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Username: `root`"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-163",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Password: `cableTV31`"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-165",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-166",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-167",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-168",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "STEP 4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-169",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "DOWNLOAD"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-170",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Download this: [https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pR0tKJQ-IbicEQstPdaIHgP9uD5hMyG3/view?usp=sharing](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pR0tKJQ-IbicEQstPdaIHgP9uD5hMyG3/view?usp=sharing)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-171",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The installer for both Mac and Windows is inside that zip file. The config is included in the Windows install file. The config for MAC is a separate file, also inside that zip folder. Install RealVNC viewer for your computer."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-172",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "When you get everything installed, connect to the VPN. You will be asked for at least your VPN password:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-175",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-173",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "User: `vera`"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-174",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Password: `njRTCV2348`"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-176",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Open Real VNC viewer and connect to the IP:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-180",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-177",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Server: `192.168.61.14`"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-178",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "User Name: `staff`"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-179",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Password: `gkieCr315`"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-181",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If not already, log in as \"staff\" using the same user and password as above."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-182",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "TRANSFERRING AND CONVERTING FILES"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-183",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I think all files will come in as either a file submission, download, or from SPNN. You will find three shortcuts on the desktop:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-187",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-184",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**\"myFFmpeg\"** is the file converter."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-185",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**\"Data1\"** has file submission files and SPNN files in it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-186",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**\"Content\"** is the video playback server."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-188",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Converting Files"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-189",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Any new files from file submission or files you download will need to be converted first. You might also want to convert the files from SPNN."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-190",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To convert the files, open \"myFFmpeg\" and drag all of the files you want to convert into the myFFmpeg. Make sure \"MP4 TRMS\" is selected on each of the videos' \"target\" drop-down."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-191",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "When you have all of the videos added, click \"Start All.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-192",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Once complete, converted files will end up in the \"data1\" shortcut, inside the \"Converted\" folder."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-193",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Transferring to Playback Server"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-194",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Move files ready to be sent to the playback server into the \"Content\" folder. Once transferred and imported, original files and converted files can be deleted from file submit, SPNN, and Converted folders. (Keep until you are sure the files imported into the playout server.)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}